{"_id":"school0000000000000001","name":"Hida Bushi School","type":"school","img":"systems/l5r4-enhanced/assets/icons/school.webp","system":{"description":"<p>Heavy armor warriors who crush enemies with brute force.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> +1 Stamina</p>\n<p><strong>Skills:</strong> Athletics, Defense, Heavy Weapons (Tetsubo), Intimidation, Kenjutsu, Lore: Shadowlands, any one Bugei Skill</p>\n<p><strong>Honor:</strong> 3.5</p>\n<p><strong>Outfit:</strong> Light or Heavy Armor, Sturdy Clothing, Daisho, Heavy Weapon or Polearm, Traveling Pack, 3 koku</p>\n\n<p>[CR p.33-56]</p>","specialRules":"<h4>RANK 1: THE WAY OF THE CRAB</h4>\n<p>Ignore TN penalties for heavy armor (except Stealth). +1k0 damage with Heavy Weapons.</p>\n\n<h4>RANK 2: THE MOUNTAIN DOES NOT MOVE</h4>\n<p>Gain Reduction equal to Earth Ring.</p>\n\n<h4>RANK 3: TWO PINCERS, ONE MIND</h4>\n<p>Attack as Simple Action with Heavy Weapons or Samurai keyword weapons.</p>\n\n<h4>RANK 4: DEVASTATING BLOW</h4>\n<p>Once per encounter with Heavy Weapon: lower enemy Reduction by 4, Daze on hit (Earth Ring vs damage TN to recover).</p>\n\n<h4>RANK 5: THE MOUNTAIN DOES NOT FALL</h4>\n<p>Spend Void Point in Reactions Stage: act as Healthy next Turn, ignore Dazed/Fatigued/Stunned until next Reactions Stage.</p>","freeRaises":0},"effects":[],"folder":"L5R4 Enhanced/Schools/Crab/Bushi","sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"school0000000000000002","name":"Hiruma Bushi School","type":"school","img":"systems/l5r4-enhanced/assets/icons/school.webp","system":{"description":"<p>Scout specialists emphasizing mobility and evasion in Shadowlands.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> +1 Willpower</p>\n<p><strong>Skills:</strong> Athletics, Hunting, Kenjutsu (Katana), Kyujutsu, Lore: Shadowlands, Stealth, any one skill</p>\n<p><strong>Honor:</strong> 4.5</p>\n<p><strong>Outfit:</strong> Ashigaru or Light Armor, Sturdy Clothing, Daisho, Bow with 20 Arrows or Knife, Traveling Pack, 3 koku</p>\n\n<p>[CR p.98-122]</p>","specialRules":"<h4>RANK 1: TORCH'S FLAME FLICKERS</h4>\n<p>+1k0 attack rolls in Attack Stance. Food/water/jade lasts twice as long for Hunting Skill Rank people.</p>\n\n<h4>RANK 2: WOLF'S LITTLE LESSON</h4>\n<p>In Attack Stance: +5 Armor TN each melee hit (stacks School Rank times, lasts until skirmish ends).</p>\n\n<h4>RANK 3: HUMMINGBIRD WINGS</h4>\n<p>Once per Round when targeted: +double School Rank to Armor TN for that attack.</p>\n\n<h4>RANK 4: SHARK SMELLS BLOOD</h4>\n<p>Attack as Simple Action with Samurai keyword weapons.</p>\n\n<h4>RANK 5: DAYLIGHT WASTES NO MOVEMENT</h4>\n<p>Excess damage from kills applies to next target hit (not two attacks in row, ends at skirmish end).</p>","freeRaises":0},"effects":[],"folder":"L5R4 Enhanced/Schools/Crab/Bushi","sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"school0000000000000003","name":"Kakita Bushi School","type":"school","img":"systems/l5r4-enhanced/assets/icons/school.webp","system":{"description":"<p>Premier dueling school, masters of iaijutsu and Center Stance.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> +1 Reflexes</p>\n<p><strong>Skills:</strong> Etiquette, Iaijutsu (Focus), Kenjutsu, Kyujutsu, Sincerity, Tea Ceremony, any one Bugei or High Skill</p>\n<p><strong>Honor:</strong> 6.5</p>\n<p><strong>Outfit:</strong> Light Armor, Sturdy Clothing, Daisho, any 1 weapon, Traveling Pack, 10 koku</p>\n\n<p>[CR p.21-53]</p>","specialRules":"<h4>RANK 1: THE WAY OF THE CRANE</h4>\n<p>Add 2x Iaijutsu Rank to Initiative. +1k1+School Rank to attack/Focus in Center Stance (and Round after).</p>\n\n<h4>RANK 2: SPEED OF LIGHTNING</h4>\n<p>+2k0 attack rolls vs lower Initiative opponents.</p>\n\n<h4>RANK 3: FIRST AND LAST STRIKE</h4>\n<p>Win Iaijutsu/Void by 3+: Strike first. Free Raise per 3 margin (not 5).</p>\n\n<h4>RANK 4: ONE STRIKE, TWO CUTS</h4>\n<p>Attack as Simple Action with Samurai keyword weapons.</p>\n\n<h4>RANK 5: STRIKE WITH NO THOUGHT</h4>\n<p>Take Simple Action in Center Stance. Gain benefits immediately, stay in Stance multiple Turns. Simple can be Move.</p>","freeRaises":0},"effects":[],"folder":"L5R4 Enhanced/Schools/Crane/Bushi","sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"school0000000000000004","name":"Daidoji Iron Warrior","type":"school","img":"systems/l5r4-enhanced/assets/icons/school.webp","system":{"description":"<p>Heavy infantry and yojimbo specialists who protect charges.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> +1 Agility</p>\n<p><strong>Skills:</strong> Battle, Defense 2, Iaijutsu, Kenjutsu (Katana), Kyujutsu, any one Skill</p>\n<p><strong>Honor:</strong> 6.5</p>\n<p><strong>Outfit:</strong> Light or Heavy Armor, Sturdy Clothing, Daisho, Heavy Weapon or Polearm, Traveling Pack, 10 koku</p>\n\n<p>[CR p.108-140]</p>","specialRules":"<h4>RANK 1: THE FORCE OF HONOR</h4>\n<p>+(Honor Rank-4, min 1) Wounds per Wound Rank. +1k0 attack in Attack Stance.</p>\n\n<h4>RANK 2: THE SHIELD OF FAITH</h4>\n<p>Guard lasts extra Round. Guard Armor TN bonus +5 (you: no penalty, target: +15 not +10).</p>\n\n<h4>RANK 3: STRIKE BENEATH THE VEIL</h4>\n<p>Melee attack as Simple Action in Attack Stance.</p>\n\n<h4>RANK 4: VIGILANCE OF MIND</h4>\n<p>Spend Void in Reactions vs attacker (you/Guard target): +2k1 attack/damage vs them next Round.</p>\n\n<h4>RANK 5: TO TREAD ON THE SWORD</h4>\n<p>Spend 2 Void when Guard target attacked: become target, Free Move Action toward them.</p>","freeRaises":0},"effects":[],"folder":"L5R4 Enhanced/Schools/Crane/Bushi","sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"school0000000000000005","name":"Mirumoto Bushi School","type":"school","img":"systems/l5r4-enhanced/assets/icons/school.webp","system":{"description":"<p>Two-sword Niten style, dual-wielding katana and wakizashi.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> +1 Stamina</p>\n<p><strong>Skills:</strong> Defense, Iaijutsu, Kenjutsu (Katana), Lore: Shugenja, Meditation, Theology, any one Bugei or High Skill</p>\n<p><strong>Honor:</strong> 4.5</p>\n<p><strong>Outfit:</strong> Light Armor, Sturdy Clothing, Daisho, any weapon, Traveling Pack, 5 koku</p>\n\n<p>[CR p.21-53]</p>","specialRules":"<h4>RANK 1: WAY OF THE DRAGON</h4>\n<p>Katana/wakizashi: no dual-wield penalties, +School Rank Armor TN. Raise/lower spell TN by 5 when targeted.</p>\n\n<h4>RANK 2: THE CALM IN MIDST OF THUNDER</h4>\n<p>In Center Stance: +Kenjutsu Rank to Iaijutsu rolls.</p>\n\n<h4>RANK 3: STRONG AND SWIFT</h4>\n<p>Attack as Simple Action with Samurai keyword weapons.</p>\n\n<h4>RANK 4: FURIOUS RETALIATION</h4>\n<p>Choose attacker in Reactions: +3k0 attack vs them next Turn.</p>\n\n<h4>RANK 5: HEART OF THE DRAGON</h4>\n<p>Attack twice with katana/wakizashi: extra off-hand attack as Free Action.</p>","freeRaises":0},"effects":[],"folder":"L5R4 Enhanced/Schools/Dragon/Bushi","sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"school0000000000000006","name":"Akodo Bushi School","type":"school","img":"systems/l5r4-enhanced/assets/icons/school.webp","system":{"description":"<p>Premier tactical school emphasizing precision and skill.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> +1 Perception</p>\n<p><strong>Skills:</strong> Battle (Mass Combat), Defense, Kenjutsu, Kyujutsu, Lore: History, Sincerity, any one Bugei or High Skill</p>\n<p><strong>Honor:</strong> 6.5</p>\n<p><strong>Outfit:</strong> Light Armor, Sturdy Clothing, Daisho, any 1 weapon, Traveling Pack, 5 koku</p>\n\n<p>[CR p.21-57]</p>","specialRules":"<h4>RANK 1: THE WAY OF THE LION</h4>\n<p>Ignore Armor TN from armor OR Free Raise when attacking. +1k0 first attack vs opponent or vs Raiser.</p>\n\n<h4>RANK 2: STRENGTH OF PURITY</h4>\n<p>Add Honor Rank to one roll per Turn (not damage, not in Center Stance).</p>\n\n<h4>RANK 3: STRENGTH OF MY ANCESTORS</h4>\n<p>Attack as Simple Action with Samurai keyword weapons.</p>\n\n<h4>RANK 4: TRIUMPH BEFORE BATTLE</h4>\n<p>Once per skirmish in Reactions: designate opponent, ignore their Stance Armor TN bonuses next Round.</p>\n\n<h4>RANK 5: AKODO'S FINAL LESSON</h4>\n<p>Raise on Bugei: meet original TN but not Raised TN = succeed without Raise benefits.</p>","freeRaises":0},"effects":[],"folder":"L5R4 Enhanced/Schools/Lion/Bushi","sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"school0000000000000007","name":"Matsu Berserker School","type":"school","img":"systems/l5r4-enhanced/assets/icons/school.webp","system":{"description":"<p>Fearless berserkers specializing in Full Attack Stance.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> +1 Strength</p>\n<p><strong>Skills:</strong> Battle, Jiujutsu, Kenjutsu (Katana), Kyujutsu, Lore: History, any two Bugei Skills</p>\n<p><strong>Honor:</strong> 6.5</p>\n<p><strong>Outfit:</strong> Light or Heavy Armor, Sturdy Clothing, Daisho, Heavy Weapon or Polearm, Traveling Pack, 5 koku</p>\n\n<p>[CR p.118-155]</p>","specialRules":"<h4>RANK 1: THE LION'S ROAR</h4>\n<p>+Honor Rank to damage. In Full Attack: +5 feet movement per Turn.</p>\n\n<h4>RANK 2: MATSU'S FURY</h4>\n<p>In Full Attack, choose target within 30': hit freezes them (no Move Actions, Willpower vs damage TN to negate).</p>\n\n<h4>RANK 3: THE LION'S CHARGE</h4>\n<p>Melee attack as Simple Action.</p>\n\n<h4>RANK 4: MATSU'S COURAGE</h4>\n<p>Ignore Wound TN penalties = Honor Rank (or 2x in Full Attack).</p>\n\n<h4>RANK 5: THE LION'S VICTORY</h4>\n<p>Once per encounter after damage: spend Void, kept dice explode (don't re-explode).</p>","freeRaises":0},"effects":[],"folder":"L5R4 Enhanced/Schools/Lion/Bushi","sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"school0000000000000008","name":"Yoritomo Bushi School","type":"school","img":"systems/l5r4-enhanced/assets/icons/school.webp","system":{"description":"<p>Versatile sea warriors who fight with unconventional weapons.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> +1 Strength</p>\n<p><strong>Skills:</strong> Commerce, Defense, Jiujutsu (Improvised Weapons), Kenjutsu, Knives (Kama), Sailing, any one Skill</p>\n<p><strong>Honor:</strong> 3.5</p>\n<p><strong>Outfit:</strong> Light Armor, Sturdy Clothing, Daisho, any 1 weapon (or pair of Knives), Traveling Pack, 10 koku</p>\n\n<p>[CR p.21-55]</p>","specialRules":"<h4>RANK 1: THE WAY OF THE MANTIS</h4>\n<p>No penalties rough terrain. No Honor/Glory loss improvised/Peasant weapons. No off-hand penalty Small/Medium Peasant weapons. +1k0 attack.</p>\n\n<h4>RANK 2: VOICE OF THE STORM</h4>\n<p>Each melee hit: -5 target Armor TN (only vs you, 2 Rounds, stacks School Rank times, resets).</p>\n\n<h4>RANK 3: STRIKE OF THE MANTIS</h4>\n<p>Attack as Simple Action with Samurai/Peasant weapons.</p>\n\n<h4>RANK 4: THE ROLLING WAVE</h4>\n<p>Move 5+ feet: +10 Armor TN until next Turn. Sacrifice for 2 Free Raises (Knockdown only).</p>\n\n<h4>RANK 5: HAND OF OSANO-WO</h4>\n<p>Spend Void: keep +Strength damage dice. Prone target: +0k2 damage.</p>","freeRaises":0},"effects":[],"folder":"L5R4 Enhanced/Schools/Mantis/Bushi","sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"school0000000000000009","name":"Tsuruchi Archer School","type":"school","img":"systems/l5r4-enhanced/assets/icons/school.webp","system":{"description":"<p>Greatest archers in the Empire, bow specialists.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> +1 Reflexes</p>\n<p><strong>Skills:</strong> Athletics, Defense, Hunting, Investigation, Kyujutsu (Yumi) 2, any one Bugei or High Skill</p>\n<p><strong>Honor:</strong> 3.5</p>\n<p><strong>Outfit:</strong> Ashigaru or Light Armor, Sturdy Clothing, Bow and 20 arrows, Wakizashi, Traveling Pack, 10 koku</p>\n\n<p>[CR p.108-141]</p>","specialRules":"<h4>RANK 1: ALWAYS BE READY</h4>\n<p>+1k0 attack with bow. +3 Initiative.</p>\n\n<h4>RANK 2: THE ARROW KNOWS THE WAY</h4>\n<p>Free Raise (Called Shot only) with bow. +2k0 damage with bow.</p>\n\n<h4>RANK 3: THE WASP'S STING</h4>\n<p>Attack as Simple Action with bow.</p>\n\n<h4>RANK 4: FLIGHT OF NO-MIND</h4>\n<p>Once per skirmish, spend Void as Complex: ignore armor/Wound/visibility, no Extra Attack, normal range.</p>\n\n<h4>RANK 5: TSURUCHI'S EYE</h4>\n<p>Ranged attack as Complex: +4k1 attack and damage. Not with Flight of No-Mind.</p>","freeRaises":0},"effects":[],"folder":"L5R4 Enhanced/Schools/Mantis/Bushi","sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"school0000000000000010","name":"Shiba Bushi School","type":"school","img":"systems/l5r4-enhanced/assets/icons/school.webp","system":{"description":"<p>Warrior-scholars protecting shugenja, masters of Void Points.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> +1 Agility</p>\n<p><strong>Skills:</strong> Defense, Kenjutsu, Kyujutsu, Meditation (Void Recovery), Spears, Theology, any one Bugei or High Skill</p>\n<p><strong>Honor:</strong> 5.5</p>\n<p><strong>Outfit:</strong> Light Armor, Sturdy Clothing, Daisho, any weapon, Traveling Pack, 5 koku</p>\n\n<p>[CR p.21-53]</p>","specialRules":"<h4>RANK 1: THE WAY OF THE PHOENIX</h4>\n<p>Spend 2 Void for +2k2 (not +1k1). Guard as Free Action (target +5 not +10 Armor TN).</p>\n\n<h4>RANK 2: DANCING WITH THE ELEMENTS</h4>\n<p>Choose target within 30' when assume Stance: raise/lower their spell TN by 5. Raise/lower spell TN targeting you by 5.</p>\n\n<h4>RANK 3: ONE WITH THE VOID</h4>\n<p>In Reactions, if anyone spent Void this Round: regain Void (can exceed max, excess lost after combat). Twice per skirmish.</p>\n\n<h4>RANK 4: MOVE WITH THE WORLD</h4>\n<p>Attack as Simple Action with Polearms/Spears/Samurai weapons.</p>\n\n<h4>RANK 5: TOUCH OF THE VOID</h4>\n<p>Each Void spent = 2x effect. Spend Void on enhancements twice per Turn.</p>","freeRaises":0},"effects":[],"folder":"L5R4 Enhanced/Schools/Phoenix/Bushi","sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"school0000000000000011","name":"Bayushi Bushi School","type":"school","img":"systems/l5r4-enhanced/assets/icons/school.webp","system":{"description":"<p>Masters of deception and dishonorable tactics.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> +1 Intelligence</p>\n<p><strong>Skills:</strong> Courtier (Manipulation), Defense, Etiquette, Iaijutsu, Kenjutsu, Sincerity, any one Skill</p>\n<p><strong>Honor:</strong> 2.5</p>\n<p><strong>Outfit:</strong> Light Armor, Sturdy Clothing, Daisho, any 1 weapon, Traveling Pack, 5 koku</p>\n\n<p>[CR p.21-51]</p>","specialRules":"<h4>RANK 1: THE WAY OF THE SCORPION</h4>\n<p>+1k1 Initiative. +5 Armor TN vs lower Initiative.</p>\n\n<h4>RANK 2: PINCERS AND TAIL</h4>\n<p>Feint for 1 Raise (not 2).</p>\n\n<h4>RANK 3: STRIKE AT THE TAIL</h4>\n<p>Choose target within 30' when assume Stance: hit Fatigues them (Earth vs TN 25 to negate).</p>\n\n<h4>RANK 4: STRIKE FROM ABOVE, STRIKE FROM BELOW</h4>\n<p>Melee attack as Simple Action.</p>\n\n<h4>RANK 5: THE PINCERS HOLD, THE TAIL STRIKES</h4>\n<p>Once per encounter, spend Void as Complex melee attack: hit Stuns (Earth vs damage to end, or next Reactions).</p>","freeRaises":0},"effects":[],"folder":"L5R4 Enhanced/Schools/Scorpion/Bushi","sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"school0000000000000012","name":"Moto Bushi School","type":"school","img":"systems/l5r4-enhanced/assets/icons/school.webp","system":{"description":"<p>Heavy cavalry with gaijin fighting style and two-handed weapons.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> +1 Strength</p>\n<p><strong>Skills:</strong> Athletics, Defense, Horsemanship, Hunting, Kenjutsu (Scimitar), any one Bugei Skill, any one Skill</p>\n<p><strong>Honor:</strong> 3.5</p>\n<p><strong>Outfit:</strong> Riding or Heavy Armor, Sturdy Clothing, Daisho, Heavy Weapon or Polearm, Traveling Pack, Horse (Unicorn riding horse), 10 koku, any one weapon</p>\n\n<p>[CR p.29-66]</p>","specialRules":"<h4>RANK 1: THE WAY OF THE UNICORN</h4>\n<p>Wield two-handed weapons one-handed (not bows). +1k0 damage mounted/scimitar/two-handed melee (don't stack). Scimitars = Samurai keyword.</p>\n\n<h4>RANK 2: SHINSEI'S SMILE</h4>\n<p>Attack bonus = half target's Wound Rank TN penalty (round down).</p>\n\n<h4>RANK 3: DESERT WIND STRIKE</h4>\n<p>Melee attack as Simple Action.</p>\n\n<h4>RANK 4: THE CHARGE OF MADNESS</h4>\n<p>Once per skirmish: kill to Out = Free Action attack different target (no Raises).</p>\n\n<h4>RANK 5: MOTO CANNOT YIELD</h4>\n<p>Mounted or Full Attack with two-handed/Samurai weapon: keep +half Strength damage dice (round down).</p>","freeRaises":0},"effects":[],"folder":"L5R4 Enhanced/Schools/Unicorn/Bushi","sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"school0000000000000013","name":"Utaku Battle Maiden","type":"school","img":"systems/l5r4-enhanced/assets/icons/school.webp","system":{"description":"<p>Elite female cavalry, finest horsewomen in the Empire.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> +1 Reflexes</p>\n<p><strong>Skills:</strong> Battle, Defense, Horsemanship 2, Kenjutsu, Sincerity, any one High or Bugei Skill</p>\n<p><strong>Honor:</strong> 6.5</p>\n<p><strong>Outfit:</strong> Light or Riding Armor, Sturdy Clothing, Daisho, any 1 weapon, Traveling Pack, Horse (Utaku Warhorse), 10 koku</p>\n\n<p>[CR p.129-166]</p>","specialRules":"<h4>RANK 1: RIDING IN HARMONY</h4>\n<p>+Honor Rank to one attack per Round (or one damage if mounted). +Honor Rank to Horsemanship.</p>\n\n<h4>RANK 2: THE VOID OF WAR</h4>\n<p>In Stage 1: add 5 to Initiative or Armor TN (lasts until used again or skirmish ends).</p>\n\n<h4>RANK 3: SENSING THE BREEZE</h4>\n<p>Mounted: attack as Simple Action.</p>\n\n<h4>RANK 4: WIND NEVER STOPS</h4>\n<p>Mounted, spend Void: Simple Action charge and attack. Hit: +2k1 damage this Turn.</p>\n\n<h4>RANK 5: OTAKU'S BLESSING</h4>\n<p>Start of Turn, spend Void: +Honor Rank to damage/Bugei this Turn (stacks with Riding in Harmony).</p>","freeRaises":0},"effects":[],"folder":"L5R4 Enhanced/Schools/Unicorn/Bushi","sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
